    "detailed_description": "Welcome to Dreamt!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn this VR puzzle game you will be exploring a mysterious but nostalgic feeling house that has  a lot of strange quirks about it. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeel free to do whatever you wish!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFind hidden minigames and puzzles around the house in order to unlock more and eventually beat the game!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhile the puzzles are important in the gameplay of Dreamt, the most fun can be had just exploring the environment, picking up interesting objects, and SMASHING THEM!<br />\r\nWe encourage it! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nUpon the first release, the game will be early access and only have its core mechanics in place with more polish and its overall conclusion coming in future updates.",
    "about_the_game": "Welcome to Dreamt!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn this VR puzzle game you will be exploring a mysterious but nostalgic feeling house that has  a lot of strange quirks about it. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeel free to do whatever you wish!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFind hidden minigames and puzzles around the house in order to unlock more and eventually beat the game!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhile the puzzles are important in the gameplay of Dreamt, the most fun can be had just exploring the environment, picking up interesting objects, and SMASHING THEM!<br />\r\nWe encourage it! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nUpon the first release, the game will be early access and only have its core mechanics in place with more polish and its overall conclusion coming in future updates.",
    "short_description": "Stuck in a dream, explore a strange house to your heart's content. It feels both familiar and completely new, like a forgotten memory.",
